1
00:02:30,142 --> 00:02:35,142
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:35,142 --> 00:02:40,142
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:40,142 --> 00:02:44,142
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:44,142 --> 00:02:49,142
Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:49,142 --> 00:02:52,142
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:52,142 --> 00:02:55,142
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:55,142 --> 00:02:58,142
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:58,142 --> 00:03:01,142
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:01,142 --> 00:03:04,142
Now this is exciting!

10
00:03:04,142 --> 00:03:07,142
I can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:07,142 --> 00:03:11,142
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:11,142 --> 00:03:15,142
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:19,142 --> 00:03:22,142
The Battle of Marineford ended with a Navy victory.

14
00:03:22,142 --> 00:03:27,142
Unable to save Ace's life, the injured Luffy was taken to Amazon Lizzie,

15
00:03:27,142 --> 00:03:30,142
where he fell into despair.

16
00:03:30,142 --> 00:03:33,142
But this is a story from another time.

17
00:03:33,142 --> 00:03:35,142
Ten years ago, in the East Blue,

18
00:03:35,142 --> 00:03:38,142
the brothers ran wild with dreams of a world full of adventure,

19
00:03:38,142 --> 00:03:41,142
as well as the pirate flags they would someday fly.

20
00:03:43,142 --> 00:03:47,142
Tucked away in Mount Corvo with Dedan and her mountain bandits,

21
00:03:47,142 --> 00:03:52,142
Ace and Luffy took a vow of brotherhood with their friend and co-conspirator, Sabo.

22
00:03:52,142 --> 00:03:56,142
We'll always be brothers and nobody can take that away.

23
00:03:58,142 --> 00:04:01,142
From now on, we're honest-to-goodness brothers.

24
00:04:01,142 --> 00:04:03,142
Cheers to that!

25
00:04:07,142 --> 00:04:09,142
Brothers!

26
00:04:09,142 --> 00:04:12,142
Too bad I'm gonna become a pirate and recruit the best cook before you do.

27
00:04:12,142 --> 00:04:16,142
Yeah, you wish! I'm gonna be a pirate before either of you don't!

28
00:04:20,142 --> 00:04:22,142
You little bastards are still spouting that pirate crap!

29
00:04:24,142 --> 00:04:28,142
You're both gonna be Marines someday, even if I gotta beat some dignity into you!

30
00:04:28,142 --> 00:04:32,142
We will stand on our feet.

31
00:04:36,142 --> 00:04:38,142
Now this is how you live!

32
00:04:38,142 --> 00:04:40,142
