184
00:11:14,122 --> 00:11:15,542
Yeah, if I thought it by myself.

185
00:11:15,822 --> 00:11:17,382
That's why we'll fight it as a team

186
00:11:17,382 --> 00:11:19,102
and just see who lands the final hit.

187
00:11:19,722 --> 00:11:20,942
Now that's a plan.

188
00:11:20,942 --> 00:11:23,622
