189
00:11:23,802 --> 00:11:24,582
Yeah, right.

190
00:11:31,222 --> 00:11:32,302
Everyone ready?

191
00:11:36,002 --> 00:11:36,602
Uh-huh.

192
00:11:37,022 --> 00:11:38,302
These were hard to catch.

193
00:11:38,622 --> 00:11:40,082
