194
00:11:40,442 --> 00:11:41,622
You knew they were bait.

195
00:11:41,902 --> 00:11:44,742
We got to think bigger if we want to fight a monster like that tiger.

196
00:11:48,782 --> 00:11:50,622
Oh, it sounds like he's on his way.

197
00:11:50,942 --> 00:11:53,662
