198
00:12:01,222 --> 00:12:02,222
Let's do it.

199
00:12:05,222 --> 00:12:06,622
Oh, oops.

200
00:12:06,882 --> 00:12:08,362
That's not a tiger.

201
00:12:08,362 --> 00:12:13,742
