Hmm.

243
00:14:47,362 --> 00:14:47,902
Hmm.

244
00:14:48,902 --> 00:14:49,902
Hmm...

245
00:14:53,902 --> 00:14:55,902
He stopped it!

246
00:15:00,902 --> 00:15:02,902
Just like shakes! So cool!

247
00:15:17,902 --> 00:15:25,902
What? You used to be a pirate, Nagari? And a captain?

248
00:15:28,902 --> 00:15:29,902
