267
00:16:40,902 --> 00:16:43,902
Hey, don't hold back, Noggity. You did save our lives.

268
00:16:43,902 --> 00:16:45,902
Thank you. But it was no trouble.

269
00:16:46,902 --> 00:16:51,902
So, you're obviously no pushover. What are you doing in a dump like Grey Terminal?

270
00:16:51,902 --> 00:16:52,902
Hmm?

271
00:16:52,902 --> 00:16:53,902
Hmm.

272
00:16:54,902 --> 00:16:56,902
